def polygon_centroid(points):
    """Computes the simple centroid of a polygon by averaging the x and y coordinates of the vertices."""
    if not points:
        return (0.0, 0.0)
    n = len(points)
    sum_x = sum(p[0] for p in points)
    sum_y = sum(p[1] for p in points)
    return (sum_x / n, sum_y / n)
```

